      <h2>HSBC Connected Money. <span class="year">2014 - 2017.</span></h2>
    </div>
    <p class="tagline">But before Mobile Banking, there was Connected Money.</p>
    <p>We dreamed of the bank of the future, that would redefine our place in the map and deliver experiential banking for our customers. We took our first steps in pursuit of that vision, and we delivered something incredible.</p>
    <p>The story is well told 👉&nbsp;<a href="https://medium.com/@mcapezzani/connecting-people-and-money-ca2d5024c82e" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">here.</a></p>
    <p>We started small. A few scrappy prototypes I coded myself, to try new ideas. Some were quite cool. The best of these we named Money Up.</p>
    <div class="shots shots-lg">
      <video autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="auto" width="270" height="480" poster="{{ '/assets/images/video-poster-e7c26868.webp' | url }}" aria-label="Money Up prototype">
